{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udce6 <i>Courier Bay: Demo</i> \u2013 Your real first day starts now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the <strong>playable demo of Courier Bay</strong>, a sneak peek into the life of a delivery driver in a city full of charm, stories, and pleasant surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this special preview, you\u2019ll experience <strong>a full working day</strong> alongside Leo, the newest recruit at <strong>Bay Express</strong>. Explore two of the city's key districts \u2014 <strong>Crystal Bay</strong> and the <strong>Farmland</strong> \u2014 in a journey packed with routes, dialogue, and discoveries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s included in the demo:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude9a <strong>8 unique deliveries</strong>: each with its own destination, challenges, and unforgettable characters.<br>\ud83d\udc64 <strong>Meet memorable NPCs</strong>: get to know people like Seu Arlindo and Elias Ramos, and discover what makes Courier Bay feel alive.<br>\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Drive multiple vehicles</strong>: take the wheel of more than one type of ride, each with its own handling and physics.<br>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Freely explore two vibrant regions</strong>: from the peaceful countryside to the lakeside mansions \u2014 but note: the Factory district is off-limits for now.<br>\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f <strong>A cozy low-poly world</strong>, complete with a relaxing soundtrack and gameplay focused on immersion and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is just the first delivery\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <i>Courier Bay</i> demo is the perfect introduction to the daily life, challenges, and connections of a delivery driver on the rise. The clock is ticking, the packages are ready \u2014 now it\u2019s your move.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800090?t=1749471292","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/st